  "interpretation": [
    "All3 S500 seeds meet validation stability from ownstage0 after inheriting full L training. Beststeps1700/1300/1500 and stops2000/2300/2000; mean full-route elapsed1907.974496s (attemptwall1936.868070s).",
    "Sbest test AbsRel .084248010410 (SD .001015828988), RMSE .342443207336, delta1 .934498175769, F1 .460971950487, band .146193794482. Sfinal AbsRel .084115343091 and F1 .458348801661.",
    "Against actual Lbest parent, Sbest improves AbsRel (-.001168491, CI[-.001687111,-.000662822]), RMSE and boundary-band error in all3seeds, but reduces F1 in all3(-.006105097); delta1 interval includes zero. Sfinal retains this overall-versus-boundary tradeoff.",
    "Both S endpoints improve overall3 and band versus B0; F1 intervals include zero. Sbest versus Jbest has overlapping-zero overall3 intervals despite lower mean AbsRel; higher mean F1 and higher boundary-band error are each driven chiefly by thirdseed, with mixed seed directions.",
    "Sfinal versus Jfinal has lower AbsRel in all3seeds and higher mean F1 driven by thirdseed (firsttwo lower); RMSE/delta1/band intervals include zero. Do not claim universally better sharpness or joint-training dominance.",
    "Best-to-final slightly reduces mean AbsRel and boundary-band error, while lowering mean F1 with first/third seeds worsening and second improving. No test-based checkpoint change.",
    "Actual fixed sample panels show close S versus parent structures, tiny error improvements in room/dining examples, slightly degraded chair edges and persistent thin-leg failures; kitchen remains worse than B0."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Sbest uses validation-selected residual weights on frozen samecount/sameseed Lbest. Sfinal-versus-Lfinal is a method-endpoint comparison, not the isolated added-residual effect; actual_parent_pairs always uses Lbest.",
    "All descriptive intervals condition on3trainingseeds and215testscenes without multiplecomparisoncorrection. Meanseed differences and signs retained; no test selection.",
    "All S seed-stability decisions come from validation. Ownstage0 does not mean zero total training: parent training and selection already occurred. Three-seed inference timings are observational and not a dedicatedbenchmark.",
    "Actualvisualreviewcovers only3fixedimages atseed320112 and bothendpoints; full654and all3seeds numerically evaluated."
  ]
